### Get all employees
GET http://localhost:8000/api/employees
Accept: application/json

###

### Get employee by ID
GET http://localhost:8000/api/employees/1
Accept: application/json

###

### Create employee
POST http://localhost:8000/api/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeCode": "EMP004",
  "firstName": "Kiran",
  "lastName": "Kumar",
  "email": "shiva123@gmail.com",
  "phoneNumber": "9876543212",
  "salary": 50000,
  "password": "Admin@123",
  "department": {
    "departmentId": 2
  }
}

###

### Update employee
PUT http://localhost:8000/api/employees/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeCode": "EMP001",
  "firstName": "Shiva",
  "lastName": "Kumar sm",
  "email": "shiva@gmail.com",
  "phoneNumber": "9876543210",
  "salary": 50000,
  "department": {
    "departmentId": 1
  }
}

###

### Delete employee
DELETE http://localhost:8000/api/employees/1
Accept: application/json

###

### Create employee - Validation Test
POST http://localhost:8000/api/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "",
  "lastName": "",
  "email": "abc",
  "phoneNumber": "",
  "salary": -1000,
  "designation": "",
  "departmentId": null
}
